<div class="sfdc_quote">Hello&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}}<br />
<br />
Following up on my email sent to invite you to participate as a&nbsp; Beta Tester for our Customer Portal.<br />
<br />
Thank you<br />
Sandy Tyrrel<br />
Business Analyst<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
--------------- Forwarded Message ---------------<br />
From: <b>Sandy Tyrrel </b> &lt;styrrel@ppi-global.com&gt;<br />
Date: November 4, 2024 at 2:21 PM<br />
Subject: Exclusive Invitation to Join PPI’s Online Customer Portal BETA Program<br />
To: ROSALIE IGAWA &lt;rosalie.igawa@motion.com&gt;<br />
&nbsp;
<div class="divReplyFwdMsg"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">Dear </span></span>ROSALIE<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">,</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">We are excited to introduce PPI's new Online Customer Portal, designed to provide you with live, real-time, 24/7 access to key resources and information. Through the portal, you will be able to:</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">1. View inventory levels at all U.S.-based locations.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">2. Check the status of orders placed both online and through our traditional inside sales channels.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">3. Access over 23,000 individual part numbers available for purchase.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">4. View and download invoice documents at your convenience.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">We’ve identified your account as an ideal candidate for our BETA program, and we would like to extend an invitation for you to participate. As a BETA participant, you’ll not only experience the portal’s full capabilities but also enjoy the following exclusive benefits:</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">1. The opportunity to provide valuable feedback to help shape the portal to better meet your needs.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">2. Personalized onboarding with our Customer Experience Team.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">3. Monthly success meetings with our Customer Experience Team to ensure you get the most from the portal.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">If you're interested in participating, please respond to this email, and a representative from PPI will reach out to begin your onboarding process. Should you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email, and we will be happy to assist you.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">Thank you for your continued partnership. We look forward to working with you through this exciting new phase.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">Best regards,&nbsp;</span></span><br />
Sandy Tyrrel<br />
Business Analyst&nbsp;</div>
</div>
